{
  "id": "JOB.22",
  "number": "22",
  "bookId": "JOB",
  "reference": "Job 22",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN except in the United Kingdom, where a Crown Copyright applies to printing the KJV. See http://www.cambridge.org/about-us/who-we-are/queens-printers-patent",
  "verseCount": 30,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "22",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JOB 22"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "22",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Eliphaz the Temanite answered and said,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Can a man be profitable unto God, as he that is wise may be profitable unto himself?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Is it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.22.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.22.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "any pleasure to the Almighty, that thou art righteous? or",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.22.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.22.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gain",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "to him",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.22.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.22.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", that thou makest thy ways perfect?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Will he reprove thee for fear of thee? will he enter with thee into judgment?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.22.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.22.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.22.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "not thy wickedness great? and thine iniquities infinite?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For thou hast taken a pledge from thy brother for nought, and stripped the naked of their clothing.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou hast not given water to the weary to drink, and thou hast withholden bread from the hungry.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "as for",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.22.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.22.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the mighty man, he had the earth; and the honourable man dwelt in it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou hast sent widows away empty, and the arms of the fatherless have been broken.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore snares",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.22.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.22.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "round about thee, and sudden fear troubleth thee;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Or darkness,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.22.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.22.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thou canst not see; and abundance of waters cover thee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.22.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.22.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "not God in the height of heaven? and behold the height of the stars, how high they are!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And thou sayest, How doth God know? can he judge through the dark cloud?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thick clouds",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.22.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.22.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a covering to him, that he seeth not; and he walketh in the circuit of heaven.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.22.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hast thou marked the old way which wicked men have trodden?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Which were cut down out of time, whose foundation was overflown with a flood:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Which said unto God, Depart from us: and what can the Almighty do for them?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yet he filled their houses with good",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "things:",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.22.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.22.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but the counsel of the wicked is far from me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The righteous see",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.22.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.22.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and are glad: and the innocent laugh them to scorn.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Whereas our substance is not cut down, but the remnant of them the fire consumeth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.22.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Acquaint now thyself with him, and be at peace: thereby good shall come unto thee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Receive, I pray thee, the law from his mouth, and lay up his words in thine heart.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If thou return to the Almighty, thou shalt be built up, thou shalt put away iniquity far from thy tabernacles.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.22.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 22:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then shalt thou lay up gold as dust, and the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "gold",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.22.24",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.22.24"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of Ophir as the stones of the brooks.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 22:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yea, the Almighty shall be thy defence, and thou shalt have plenty of silver.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.22.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.22.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 22:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For then shalt thou have thy delight in the Almighty, and shalt lift up thy face unto God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.22.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.22.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 22:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou shalt make thy prayer unto him, and he shall hear thee, and thou shalt pay thy vows.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.22.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 22:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou shalt also decree a thing, and it shall be established unto thee: and the light shall shine upon thy ways.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.22.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.22.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 22:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.22.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.22.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "men",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.22.29",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.22.29"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "are cast down, then thou shalt say,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.22.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.22.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "There is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOB.22.29",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOB.22.29"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lifting up; and he shall save the humble person.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.22.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.22.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.22.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.22.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 22:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He shall deliver the island of the innocent: and it is delivered by the pureness of thine hands.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.22.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.22.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
